'''Meownesday''' (水曜にゃんこDAY, ''Suiyō Nyanko DAY '', '''Wednesday Cat DAY''') is an event that is held every Wednesday in [[The Battle Cats]]. This event features [[Treasure Festival]]s, half [[Cat Energy|Energy]] cost for [[Main Chapters Levels]], [[Stories of Legend]] and [[Uncanny Legends]], XP Harvest open for [[Gamatoto Expedition|Gamatoto]], half XP for one unit and unique Energy refunds. It was introduced in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

On Wednesdays that have the date of the 22nd, an '''Uber Meownesday''' (超水曜にゃんこDAY, ''Chō Suiyō Nyanko DAY '', '''Super Wednesday Cat DAY''') is held.

==Event Information==
When Meow Meow Day and Meownesday align... miracles can happen!<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Uber Meownesday'''}} is coming soon, so don't miss out!<br>

Event Schedule:<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Wednesday the 22nd, 12:00AM to 11:59PM!'''}}

Enjoy bonus events leading up to Uber Meownesday!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Uber Meownesday Login Bonuses!'''}}<br>
Get a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Platinum Ticket'''}} just by logging in!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Half-off level-up and evolution costs for all Cats!'''}}<br>
Give your Cats a quick boost while you can!

※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Challenge the Golden Tower for huge rewards!'''}}<br>
A shining spire offering glorious riches to those brave enough to challenge the climb!<br>
Get bigger and better rewards as you clear higher floors in this tough training trial!

Look forward to even MORE awesome events on Uber Meownesday itself!<br>
Don't forget to visit The Battle Cats on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Wednesday the 22nd'''}} to take advantage of all the awesome campaign content!

